  "data": {
    "summary": "Whenever this unit makes a Normal, Fall Back or Advance move:\n\n- Its models can pass through any model without **TITANIC**, and move horizontally across terrain sections up to 4\" high.\n- Before it moves, you may give all its models **MOBILE** for that move; if you choose to, roll a D6 after it, and on a 1 the unit is Battle-shocked.\n\n**MOBILE** lets the models cross dense terrain horizontally during that move. See **[Super-heavy Walker](vsdata:core-rule/super-heavy-walker)** and **[Terrain and Movement](vsdata:core-rule/terrain-and-movement)**.",
